  "title": "Superhuman Data: How Data Quality Drives AI Reliability",
  "summary": "AI is fast, but accuracy remains the real barrier to safe deployment. This post explains how poor data quality, collapsed expert disagreement, and weak evaluation create false confidence in production AI. It shows how collective intelligence, gold-standard labeling, and human-in-the-loop workflows at Centaur.ai build auditable, high-accuracy datasets for high-stakes applications.",
